  "prefLabel": "Phy 302.08 General supervision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 302.08 “General supervision” means “general supervision” as defined in RSA 328-A:2, V, namely, “that the physical therapist is not required to be on-site for direction and supervision, but must be available at least by telecommunications.”\n\nSource. #9233, eff 8-22-08; ss by #10933, eff 9-18-15; ss by #12864, eff 9-10-19; ss by #14563, eff 6-20-26, EXPIRES: 6-20-36",
